          "kicker": "Coaching appointment",
          "heading": "Jake White confirmed as Fiji head coach, succeeding interim Senirusi Seruvakula",
          "body": "Jake White, the 2007 World Cup-winning Springbok coach, has been confirmed as Fiji's head coach, the Fiji Rugby Union announced on Tuesday after a field of 31 applicants. He replaces interim coach Senirusi Seruvakula, and the appointment follows Monday's Fiji Sun report that Warren Gatland, the former Wales and British & Irish Lions coach, was close to the job. White's brief is the 2027 World Cup, and he has said: \"Next year is about building depth and, obviously, the last block is to peak before the World Cup.\""
