          "kicker": "Contract news",
          "heading": "Manny Iyogun signs new Northampton deal, keeping England prop at Franklin's Gardens",
          "body": "Manny Iyogun, the Northampton academy product who made his England Test debut off the bench against Argentina in July, has signed a new contract at Franklin's Gardens, extending beyond the current season. The 25-year-old loosehead has 104 senior appearances for Saints and follows Tommy Freeman, Henry Pollock and Tom Pearson in re-signing with the Prem champions. Saints director of rugby Phil Dowson praised him as a brilliant character who embodies the club's values, and Iyogun says staying was an easy decision."
