          "heading": "Stade Français's Paul Gustard fears Lucas Peyresblanques out five to six months",
          "body": "Stade Français have lost hooker Lucas Peyresblanques to a fractured fibula, and coach Paul Gustard says they risk losing him for five to six months. The 27-year-old underwent surgery on Sunday after being cleared out at a breakdown against Montpellier. Gustard also flagged centre Noah Nene, who could be out around two weeks, while the extent of No. 8 Yoan Tanga's rib injury is unclear. SA Rugby Magazine reports the trio are set to miss Saturday's Champions Cup opener at the Bulls."
