          "heading": "Argentina join Uruguay, Chile and Brazil in joint 2035 World Cup bid",
          "body": "Argentina have joined Uruguay, Chile and Brazil in submitting a joint bid to host the 2035 World Cup, with the report surfacing in early October. A shared bid puts the Pumas' ambitions beyond the Nations Championship table and alongside their neighbours, a regional project rather than a solo one. Those ambitions sit against a 24-31 defeat to England in Round 3, which leaves Argentina eighth of 12 in the log."
