      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Eligibility question",
          "heading": "Mark Nawaqanitawase unavailable for Wallabies' UK tests, weighing Fiji or Italy",
          "body": "Mark Nawaqanitawase will not be available for the Wallabies' away Nations Championship Tests against England, Scotland and Wales, his agent Milan Volavola-Shankar told Code Sports. Volavola-Shankar said Nawaqanitawase told Les Kiss, the Wallabies coach, of the decision in July, before he joins the Panasonic Wild Knights in Japan. The 26-year-old qualifies for Fiji through his biological father and is also eligible for Italy, and his three-year stand-down ends in August next year, with any decisions to be considered \"at the appropriate time\"."
        },
        {
