          "heading": "Japan's last 11 matches: 309 points scored and 308 conceded in total",
          "body": "Across their last 11 matches, Japan have scored 309 points and conceded 308, averages of 28.1 and 28 a game. Their biggest win in that stretch was a 63-14 home victory over USA in September, in the Pacific Nations Cup Knockout Stage. Each figure refers to those 11 matches only, so the averages and the 63-14 result belong to the same window."
